{"3141520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape Game: Galleria", "steam_appid": 3141520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Game: Galleria is a 3D HD enhanced First Person PC Version of Escape Game: Galleria previously released on iOS and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape from this place by exploring, collecting items, and solve the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D + Mouse: Move &amp; Look </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Examine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap on the item icon twice to take a closer look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a closer look, sometimes you can examine more by tapping on the zoomed image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you can  combine items by selecting another item and tap on the zoomed item image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・3D HD Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・First Person Puzzle Solving Adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・7 Item Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Autosave </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Single Ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Video Distribution Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Posting and streaming videos are allowed without permission whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Monetization only allowed using the features provided by video distribution platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please include the game's name in the title of your video or stream and add a link to the Steam page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・We do not take any responsibilities for any issues occured by you posting videos or streaming this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The contents of these guidelines may change without notice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Game: Galleria is a 3D HD enhanced First Person PC Version of Escape Game: Galleria previously released on iOS and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape from this place by exploring, collecting items, and solve the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D + Mouse: Move &amp; Look </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Examine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap on the item icon twice to take a closer look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While taking a closer look, sometimes you can examine more by tapping on the zoomed image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you can  combine items by selecting another item and tap on the zoomed item image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・3D HD Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・First Person Puzzle Solving Adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・7 Item Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Autosave </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Single Ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Video Distribution Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Posting and streaming videos are allowed without permission whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Monetization only allowed using the features pr